{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依都市危險及老舊建築物加速重建條例（以下簡稱本條例）第四條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"D0000214/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"8a725caae511bcbbd59f1db9468ea8148c03c7b5fce2e10069a3d7acd74e24df","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":41,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）主管機關為處理本條例第三條第一項第二款、第三款結構安全性能評估結果異議案件，應組成鑑定小組（以下簡稱本小組）。","id":"D0000214/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"34f73060fcc5af9ce3e19931489b95c14bae5ea8ae966afe95c8f9cdac137ee5","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":63,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本小組置委員十一人至十五人，其中一人為召集人，由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關首長或其指派之人員兼任，其餘委員由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關就下列人員聘（派）兼之：\n一、建築管理、都市更新及其他有關業務人員。\n二、具有土木、結構及建築專門學識之專家學者。\n三、土木技師、結構技師及建築師之公會代表。\n前項第二款、第三款之專家學者及團體代表，合計不得少於委員總數二分之一。\n本小組任一性別委員，不得少於委員總數三分之一。","id":"D0000214/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"e4beec685030a29b90924a12245ee051ba1a6e44e4faa2034d4ef6463fe1e2f5","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":145,"children":[{"id":"D0000214/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":78,"end":100,"children":[]},{"id":"D0000214/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":100,"end":123,"children":[]},{"id":"D0000214/a:3/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":123,"end":145,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0000214/a:3/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":145,"end":181,"children":[]},{"id":"D0000214/a:3/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":181,"end":204,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"本小組委員任期二年，期滿得續聘（派）兼之。但代表機關出任者，應隨其本職進退。\n委員出缺時，應予補聘；補聘委員之任期至原委員任期屆滿之日為止。","id":"D0000214/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"5f8d22cde058283116b9a3bba3de3034aab68f19afd140f706bfb18e0f6cfb50","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":39,"children":[]},{"id":"D0000214/a:4/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":39,"end":70,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"本小組置執行秘書一人及其他工作人員若干人，均由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關就現有員額中派兼之。","id":"D0000214/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"2c641190b9164e327e635e7a76b8cb53937215e854119ee1b68b56fb46b0a7b7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":45,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"本小組會議由召集人召集，並為會議主席；召集人不克出席會議時，由出席委員互推一人代理主席。\n本小組委員應親自出席會議。但第三條第一項第一款之委員，因故不能親自出席時，得指派代表出席，並參與會議發言及表決。","id":"D0000214/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"301acc002ab4a900c7ec2689ff87780bd05735322f3b1261b1d0fc964bd95cb3","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":45,"children":[]},{"id":"D0000214/a:6/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":45,"end":101,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"本小組會議應有全體委員過半數出席，始得開會；出席委員過半數之同意，始得決議；可否同數時，由主席裁決之。","id":"D0000214/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"85f687e438959f8e6b93820ea7049919c7a21bc29bfbb735530a8343f770bca3","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":51,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"本小組委員或工作人員對於鑑定案件之迴避，依行政程序法第三十二條及第三十三條規定辦理。","id":"D0000214/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"92d5f065415926001a8887c17b0b95d108b2fe53711e7ce5bb1a21858ab4424b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":42,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"本小組委員及工作人員均為無給職。","id":"D0000214/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"65ce886afc993649bb84cbb61d48908569e2e53446e3e69a56425da94f3fdc96","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":16,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"依本條例第四條第二項規定申請鑑定者，應檢附建築物結構安全性能評估報告書及相關資料，向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關提出。","id":"D0000214/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"56867576b25636afd02476b7ccab8021e5e590fc6f6a138853daac1aaebe51dd","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":57,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"本小組辦理鑑定作業，規定如下：\n一、由召集人指定第三條第一項第二款、第三款之委員二人或三人為預審委員，先就申請案件審核，並擬具意見提交本小組會議討論。\n二、委員認有實地履勘必要者，應通知申請人及相關人員配合現場履勘，並作成紀錄供本小組會議審查。","id":"D0000214/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"63a564aba8285fc4b06f36d6777c9d3159842bf494c90b3eb8d568fc3f5c022f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":122,"children":[{"id":"D0000214/a:11/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":16,"end":76,"children":[]},{"id":"D0000214/a:11/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":76,"end":122,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"本小組進行預審、現場履勘及小組會議時，應通知申請人到場陳述意見。","id":"D0000214/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"d36180da57af1d1d67eb97e5bc1ec90c2afe5eff2173310b47929ab3ddd229aa","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":32,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"本小組會議決議事項，應於會議後十日內作成會議紀錄，經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關首長核可後，以直轄市、縣（市）主管機關名義書面通知申請人鑑定結果。","id":"D0000214/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"d9edf369099d9e38b8927b6c3cd6d1ca6a0bce7d5802dce3d4720213f61bf2c5","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":71,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":[],"text":"本小組所需經費，應由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關於年度預算中編列之。","id":"D0000214/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"8a571eb13fc8a687d79782d38161ffacd73e5a85b04d869a124fa9e2753db80a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:14/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":32,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 15 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"D0000214/a:15","anchor":"a-15","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0000214/a:15/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"都市更新與危老","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國一百零六年八月三日內政部台內營字第 1060810414 號令訂定\n  發布全文 15 條；並自發布日施行","id":"D0000214","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2017-08-03","name":"直轄市縣（市）合法建築物結構安全性能評估結果異議鑑定小組設置辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0000214","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"7e9ffa74189add89732f8062d3b2ea790c6b6b0b92c2d3eb2d06ccd083ccc80d","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2017-08-03","effectiveDate":""}}